s Privacy Policy Accessibility Sitemap Intranet search search Startpage Career Working at KIT Karlsruhe Institute of Technology KIT Topics Studies Research Innovation Career Career Working at KIT KIT for International Talent Get Started Application Process Jobs Working at KIT Work Culture Diversity Benefits Working Environment Working at KIT Working at KIT means more than just job security in the public sector: Here, you can shape the future – with responsibility, creative freedom, and equal opportunities. Whether in a diverse and intercultural team, in the lab, or in the office: Our working environment will inspire you. People grow with us, drive change, and are supported by programs that really make a difference in everyday life. What sets us apart: Meaningful tasks from AI to climate protection Security of public service Collaboration across disciplines Reliable, flexible, and family-friendly working conditions Opportunities for development and modern, easily accessible infrastructure Diversity, respect, and equal opportunities Gabi Zachmann, KIT Collaboration, trust, and creative freedom: Learn how we make innovation possible in everyday life. Our Work Culture Magali Hauser, KIT Different experiences and perspectives enrich our inclusive, respectful, and open community. Diversity at KIT KIT Professional development, family-friendly services, health benefits, and reliable working conditions: Your advantages at a glance. Our Benefits KIT Well-connected, green, and integrated: Get to know our locations and their working environments. Working Environment Contact Karlsruhe Institute of Technology Phone: +49 721 608-0 Fax: +49 721 608-44290 Staff Search Address Media Press Releases Contact for Media Applying Jobs Degree Programs Trainee Positions Doctorate Visiting How to reach the KIT Campus Map Events KIT-Shop Instagram Profile Facebook Profile Youtube Profile Mastodon Profile LinkedIn Profile last change:\n                        2026-05-06 KIT – The University in 