Privacy Policy Accessibility Sitemap Intranet search search Startpage Career Working at KIT Work Culture Karlsruhe Institute of Technology KIT Topics Studies Research Innovation Career Career Working at KIT KIT for International Talent Get Started Application Process Jobs Working at KIT Work Culture Diversity Benefits Working Environment Work Culture Our Work Culture Interdisciplinary, diverse, and open-minded – innovation happens when different perspectives meet. We create an environment in which people feel secure, ask questions, take responsibility, and courageously break new ground. Clear structures and reliable processes provide orientation; at the same time, we create space for your ideas to unfold and for you to develop professionally and personally. We take responsibility, think ahead, and shape the future together. Responsibility with Impact Science means responsibility for society, technology, the environment, and our diverse community. We work in a solution-oriented manner and put knowledge to effective use. Diversity That Connects Diversity in the workplace leads to more innovative solutions.  We promote respectful cooperation in international and interdisciplinary teams. . Stability That Creates Free Space Secure conditions in public service and clear processes create reliability – and space for new ideas. Development with Prospects Do you want to shape and grow? We support your individual development – with further training and compatible working conditions for different life situations. . Innovation As an Attitude Research is our driving force: We translate findings into effective solutions – from the laboratory to practical application. . You may also be interested in: Working Environment Dversity Benefits Application Process Contact Karlsruhe Institute of Technology Phone: +49 721 608-0 Fax: +49 721 608-44290 Staff Search Address Media Press Releases Contact for Media Applying Jobs Degree Programs Trainee Positions Doctorate Visiting How to reach the KIT Campus Map Events KIT-Shop Instagram Profile Facebook Profile Youtube Profile Mastodon Profile LinkedIn Profile last change:\n                        2026-05-06 KIT – The University in the Helmholtz Association Home Plain Language Legals Privacy Policy Accessibility Sitemap Intranet KIT"
    },
