s Privacy Policy Accessibility Sitemap Intranet search search Startpage Career Get Started Infrastructure Karlsruhe Institute of Technology KIT Topics Studies Research Innovation Career Career Working at KIT KIT for International Talent Get Started Application Process Jobs Get Started Science Infrastructure Administration Vocational Training and Cooperative Study Programs Students Infrastructure A Career in Infrastructure You can help shape the technical foundation for cutting-edge research in facility management, IT roles, technical professions, or laboratory and workshop positions. Your work has a direct impact every single day. In our workshops, datacenters, and laboratories, our people work to find solutions.  We support you with continued education, personal development, and a strong community. Career paths Jobs in Engineering, IT, and Maintenance You will design and build test facilities, work in laboratory analysis, maintain technical systems, or manage the IT infrastructure and system administration. Your work will keep our research operations running smoothly: From circuit layouts to ventilation systems, from workbenches to server operations. We value technical expertise, hands-on skills, diverse teams, and a strong team spirit. KIT organization at a glance KIT Technical Professions Construction, maintenance, and operation of technical facilities Building technology and energy supply Maintenance of test facilities KIT Jobs in Laboratories and Workshops Work in physics and chemistry laboratories Equipment maintenance, measuring and testing technology Support of research projects KIT Jobs in IT and System Administration Server operation and network technology IT support and user management Software deployment and IT security What you will find here Secure Employment Reliable prospects in the public sector combining purpose and stability. Opportunities for Development Workshops, continued education, and clear career paths: We support your skills and help you grow. . Work-life Balance Flexible hours, remote work, and easy-to-plan vacations help you balance your job and personal life. Cooperative Working Atmosphere Respectful, on equal footing, together: A variety of perspectives and genuine teamwork. . Apply Now The KIT Job Portal provides an overview of all open positions in technology, infrastructure, and administration. Discover new opportunities and apply now. Job Offers You may also be interested in: Benefits Diversity Working Environment Work Culture Contact Karlsruhe Institute of Technology Phone: +49 721 608-0 Fax: +49 721 608-44290 Staff Search Address Media Press Releases Contact for Media Applying Jobs Degree Programs Trainee Positions Doctorate Visiting How to reach the KIT Campus Map Events KIT-Shop Instagram Profile Facebook Profile Youtube Profile Mastodon Profile LinkedIn Profile last change:\n                        2026-05-06 KIT – The University in the Helmholtz Association Home Plain Language Legals Privacy Policy Accessibility Sitemap Intranet KIT"
