s Privacy Policy Accessibility Sitemap Intranet search search Startpage Career Get Started Administration Karlsruhe Institute of Technology KIT Topics Studies Research Innovation Career Career Working at KIT KIT for International Talent Get Started Application Process Jobs Get Started Science Infrastructure Administration Vocational Training and Cooperative Study Programs Students Administration Your Career in Administration In our administration, you help shape the framework for cutting-edge research, teaching, and knowledge transfer in a diverse work environment. You organize, manage, communicate, and create reliable structures for students and staff. Bring your experience and background to the table, we value international diversity and teamwork. Career paths Examples of Occupational Fields in Administration We offer a wide range of roles that give you the freedom to shape your work. You can contribute your unique skills to our intercultural teams in a way that is flexible and tailored to your personal lifestyle. Research management , e. g., grant acquisition, grant application and third-party funding management. Quality management and science communication , e. g. public relations. Human resources, finance, and legal affairs , e. g. accounting, human resources development, legal consulting. Student services , e. g., student guidance and counseling Institute administration , e. g., secretarial work and administrative processes. Innovation and relations management , e.g.  intrapreneurship projects, inventor consulting, technology commercialization, startup consulting, or innovation projects Library services , e. g., support for subject-specific divisions. KIT organization at a glance What you will find here Work That Makes a Difference Your administrative work lays the foundation for excellent research that delivers tangible benefits for society and the future. Work-life Integration Flexible work hours and remote work: These options help you better balance your professional and personal life. . Secure Employment Meaningful work in the public sector with a stable environment, long-term prospects, and opportunities for development. . Opportunities for Development Workshops, continued education, and clear career paths: We support your skills and help you grow. Apply Now The KIT Job Portal provides an overview of all open positions in technology, infrastructure, and administration. Discover new opportunities and apply now. Job Offers You may also be interested in: Benefits Diversity Working Environment Work Culture Contact Karlsruhe Institute of Technology Phone: +49 721 608-0 Fax: +49 721 608-44290 Staff Search Address Media Press Releases Contact for Media Applying Jobs Degree Programs Trainee Positions Doctorate Visiting How to reach the KIT Campus Map Events KIT-Shop Instagram Profile Facebook Profile Youtube Profile Mastodon Profile LinkedIn Profile last change:\n                        2026-05-06 KIT – The University in the Helmholtz Association Home Plain Language Legals Privacy Policy Accessibility Sitemap Intranet KIT"
