acy Policy Accessibility Sitemap Intranet search search Startpage Career Get Started Students Karlsruhe Institute of Technology KIT Topics Studies Research Innovation Career Career Working at KIT KIT for International Talent Get Started Application Process Jobs Get Started Science Infrastructure Administration Vocational Training and Cooperative Study Programs Students Students Jobs for Students As a Student Assistant, Intern, or Thesis Student: Gain Practical Experience, Build Your Network, and Flexibly Combine Your Studies with Work at KIT. At KIT, you can gain valuable practical experience right from the start of your studies. Whether in the lab, in administration, or in research: You will be right in the thick of things from the start and learn how your theoretical knowledge applies in everyday practice. This way, you take on responsibility, collaborate on real projects, and build a network in the scientific community early on. KIT Student Assistants Make a difference in research or administration: Gain hands-on experience alongside your studies. Jobs for Students KIT Internships Mandatory or voluntary internships: Gain insights into research, technology, and administration. Contact the relevant department. Organization KIT Theses Relevant scientific or practical thesis, with excellent supervision. Topics KIT Doctorate The path to research: Framework, supervision, networking. Doing a Doctorate What you will find at KIT Insights into Professional Settings Take on responsibility early on in real projects. Apply Your Knowledge Put what you learn in lectures to use in the lab and in your daily team work. Balance Your Studies and Work Flexible working hours that fit your course schedule. Build Networks Connect with people who share your passion for research. You may also be interested in: Diversity Working Environment Contact Karlsruhe Institute of Technology Phone: +49 721 608-0 Fax: +49 721 608-44290 Staff Search Address Media Press Releases Contact for Media Apply