Policy Accessibility Sitemap Intranet search search Startpage Career Jobs Karlsruhe Institute of Technology KIT Topics Studies Research Innovation Career Career Working at KIT KIT for International Talent Get Started Application Process Jobs Jobs Job Openings Whether you are just starting your career, or looking to take the next step: You will find the right job among KIT's job listings. We offer prospects in science, administration, infrastructure, and teaching for experienced, curious, and ambitious individuals. Our Job Portal is updated regularly. No suitable openings today? Then be sure to check back in a few days. Jobs for student assistants, thesis projects (bachelor’s and master’s), or internships are available on the Career Service Portal . You can find an overview of available training positions on the Vocational Training Portal . We look forward to receiving your application! Discover Our Jobs You may also be interested in: Benefits Diversity Working Environment Work Culture Contact Karlsruhe Institute of Technology Phone: +49 721 608-0 Fax: +49 721 608-44290 Staff Search Address Media Press Releases Contact for Media Applying Jobs Degree Programs Trainee Positions Doctorate Visiting How to reach the KIT Campus Map Events KIT-Shop Instagram Profile Facebook Profile Youtube Profile Mastodon Profile LinkedIn Profile last change:\n                        2026-06-05 KIT – The University in the Helmholtz Association Home Plain Language Legals Privacy Policy Accessibility Sitemap Intranet KIT"
