on partner Publish job offers for students Publish thesis for students Register Let's go Welcome to the Career Service We support students and graduates in finding their way in the professional world. Whether internships, job offers, career planning or personal development - you will find tips and help at the Career Service. We offer companies the opportunity to meet committed young talent at KIT. In particular, we invite regional companies to join us in retaining expertise within the Karlsruhe technology region and strengthening this business hub. Alumnae and alumni can exchange ideas and network in the large alumni network. To the Alumni website Use the features The Login Area Log in once, access all benefits: The login area provides tailored services – individually designed for students, employers, and KIT staff. For students Book a counseling appointment : Get personal feedback on your application documents or receive coaching for career orientation. Save your job search : Receive current job postings by email or save interesting offers to your watchlist. Get found with your profile : Create your student profile and let suitable employers contact you directly. Coming soon : A new matching feature will automatically suggest jobs, companies, and events that fit your profile. More information on data protection To the Student Login For companies Stay up to date : Subscribe to the newsletter with current offers on recruiting & employer branding as well as special mailings for the KIT Career Fair and more. Publish job vacancies : Book job ads in the job market for KIT students. Find talents : Book access to student profiles and search specifically for suitable young professionals from KIT. Boost your visibility : Book your company profile on our website, campus advertising , or additional online placements for your recruiting events. More information on the General Terms and Conditions and on data protection . To the registration For KIT internals Post your job offers for student assistants and internships at KIT in the job market. Publish your thesis topics for Bachelor’s and Master’s students. More information on data protection . To the KIT login Top Jobs in our job market Phorms Baden-Württemberg gemeinnützige GmbH Lehrkraft Informatik / Informatiklehrer (m/w/d) – Sekundarstufe I Permanent position Permanent position Baden-Württemberg Job vacancy: From now on ZYTOLabor Karlsruhe Dr. Matthes Ausbildung zum Zytologieassistent/in (w/m/d) Permanent position Permanent position Karlsruhe city, Karlsruhe region Job vacancy: From now on Eurovent Technical Officer Permanent position Permanent position Germany Job vacancy: From now on Palas GmbH Aerosol Research Scientist (PhD) - all genders Permanent position Permanent position International excluding Germany Job vacancy: From now on Storch und Beller & Co GmbH Mitarbeiter (m/w/d) im mobilen Kundenservice auf Minijobbasis Working student Temporary employment Karlsruhe city, Karlsruhe region Job vacancy: From now on KVBW Kommunaler Versorgungsverband Baden-Württemberg Werkstudent (m/w/d) Datenkorrektur Working student Temporary employment Karlsruhe city, Karlsruhe region Job vacancy: From now on Dastex GmbH Werkstudent Marketing (m/w/d) Working student Permanent position Karlsruhe city, Karlsruhe region Job vacancy: From now on Dastex GmbH Werkstudent HR (m/w/d) Working student Permanent position Karlsruhe city, Karlsruhe region Job vacancy: From now on LANG Bau GmbH & Co. KG Junior Bauleiter Hochbau / Rohbau (m/w/d) Permanent position Permanent position Karlsruhe city, Karlsruhe region Job vacancy: From now on Karlsruher Verkehrs Verbund GmbH (KVV) Werkstudent*in im Bereich Marketing Ref. 2026_109 Working student Temporary employment Karlsruhe city, Karlsruhe region Job vacancy: From now on Fraunhofer-Institut für Angewandte Festkörperphysik IAF romotion im Bereich Prozesstechnologie - neuartige digitale III-V-Halbleiterkonzepte Promotion Temporary employment Baden-Württemberg Job v